'''Suffering Spring!''' (イースター 強襲！, ''Īsutā Kyōshū！'', '''Easter Assault!''') is an Easter stage added in the [[Version 10.3 Update]]. This [[Gauntlet]] features enemies from the [[Cats Abloom!]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
Suffering Spring! contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Eggs of Chaos Lvs''' (エッグ Lvs.). After beating three Eggs of Chaos lv, the player must wait for 30 minutes before they may enter the map again. Rewards for the first completion of an Eggs of Chaos can include XP, [[Catfruit]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]], [[Ototo Corps|Materials]] and [[Cat Energy|Leaderships]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Suffering Spring!/Eggs of Chaos Lv.1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Suffering Spring! is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1.

